{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06PV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descent-flat}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:335bd39478024aec251dd74d76932b87aaad30c31003a486ec4656524f42cd0c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c1a6f928c4d5a8fdf9492eeb7d8e9780522d8af7327ecc779e5b768cf22cc8c2", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a surjective flat morphism of algebraic\nstacks. If the base change\n<MATH_0003>\nis flat, then <MATH_0004> is flat.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5463addb95558cc43e0f773338588d14d13d278dba5624a4aaf4908ff8c6098e", "unit_id": "tag:06PZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06PV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$W$", "MATH_0002": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0006": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0008": "$W$", "MATH_0009": "$V$", "MATH_0010": "$V \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0011": "$U$", "MATH_0012": "$U \\to V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0013": "$U \\to V$", "MATH_0014": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0015": "$U' = W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} U$", "MATH_0016": "$V' = W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} V$", "MATH_0017": "$\\mathcal{X}' = W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{Y}' = W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{Y} = W$", "MATH_0019": "$U' \\to V' \\times_{\\mathcal{Y}'} \\mathcal{X}'$", "MATH_0020": "$\\mathcal{X}' \\to \\mathcal{Y}'$", "MATH_0021": "$U' \\to V'$", "MATH_0022": "$V' \\to V$", "MATH_0023": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0024": "$U \\to V$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-smooth-flat}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-composition-surjective}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-composition-flat}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-flat}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-base-change-module-flat}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:675e3ea09c17f942927d708bff972f971a772977308109b8e038f28f62c6a17e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c50ecbf5bd565eef68221857745f5128ed67510531861b3149e6f4ed8a02bfa6", "source_text": "Choose an algebraic space <MATH_0001> and a surjective smooth morphism\n<MATH_0002>. Then <MATH_0003> is surjective and flat\n(Morphisms of Spaces, Lemma <REF_0001>)\nhence <MATH_0004> is surjective and flat (by\nProperties of Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0002>\nand\nLemma <REF_0003>).\nSince the base change of\n<MATH_0005>\nby <MATH_0006> is a flat morphism\n(Lemma <REF_0004>)\nwe may replace <MATH_0007> by <MATH_0008>.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nChoose an algebraic space <MATH_0009> and a surjective smooth morphism\n<MATH_0010>. Choose an algebraic space <MATH_0011> and a surjective\nsmooth morphism <MATH_0012>.\nWe have to show that <MATH_0013> is flat. Now we base change\neverything by <MATH_0014>: Set <MATH_0015>,\n<MATH_0016>,\n<MATH_0017>,\nand <MATH_0018>.\nThen it is still true that <MATH_0019>\nis smooth by base change. Hence by our definition of flat morphisms\nof algebraic stacks and the assumption that <MATH_0020>\nis flat, we see that <MATH_0021> is flat. Then, since\n<MATH_0022> is surjective as a base change of <MATH_0023> we see\nthat <MATH_0024> is flat by\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0005> (2)\nand we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d3993b955712b4453cea5f2426d0c7b7ad8828956540ecffabe7934190343c25", "unit_id": "tag:06PZ:proof"}
